#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/7zip.xml:26
#, xml-text
msgid "Introduction to 7zip"
msgstr "Introdução ao 7zip"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/7zip.xml:29
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>7zip</application> is a file archiver that archives with high "
"compression ratios. It handles 7z, ZIP, GZIP, Brotli, BZIP2, XZ, TAR, APM, "
"ARJ, CAB, CHM, CPIO, CramFS, DEB, DMG, FAT, HFS, ISO, Lizard, LZ5, LZFSE, "
"LZH, LZMA, LZMA2, MBR, MSI, MSLZ, NSIS, NTFS, RAR, RPM, SquashFS, UDF, VHD, "
"WIM, XAR, Z, and Zstd formats."
msgstr ""
"<application>7zip</application> é um arquivador de arquivos que arquiva com "
"altas taxas de compressão. Ele lida com os formatos 7z, ZIP, GZIP, Brotli, "
"BZIP2, XZ, TAR, APM, ARJ, CAB, CHM, CPIO, CramFS, DEB, DMG, FAT, HFS, ISO, "
"Lizard, LZ5, LZFSE, LZH, LZMA, LZMA2, MBR, MSI, MSLZ, NSIS, NTFS, RAR, RPM, "
"SquashFS, UDF, VHD, WIM, XAR, Z e Zstd."

